  "id": "AI_Agents_Are_Shifting_Identity_Security_Budget_Dynamics_txt_6",
  "content": "AI agent populations are expanding and evolving toward autonomous systems operating at machine speed, accessing sensitive data, APIs, and workflows across hybrid environments. The proliferation of identities and privileges is a challenge today, and will become even more so as AI agents needing authentication, fine-grained authorization, governance, and life cycle management move into production. Identity leaders and leaders driving AI initiatives recognize the need for IAM discipline for this new class of identities, which represent a significant expansion of the enterprise attack surface.",
